            "line": 93,
            "text": "theorem rowDensity_increment {n : ℕ} (hn : 0 < n) (u e : History) (omega du de : Profile)\n    (R : ℝ) :\n    rowDensity n (increment u n du) (increment e n de) omega R =\n      rowDensity n u e omega R + linearDensity (u 0) (e 0) du de R"
